# The translation CSV is written by `dart run scripts/move.dart export`, which
# emits CRLF row terminators (package:csv's default eol). With core.autocrlf
# stripping those on commit and never restoring them, the working copy and the
# committed file disagreed, and `import` wrote whichever line ending it happened
# to read into the generated locale ARBs — flipping \n and \r\n back and forth
# across seven commits. Pinning the working copy to LF makes the import
# deterministic whoever runs it.
shared/heart_language/scripts/translations.csv text eol=lf
